// Ch5 B08 → B09 (act1_ch05.md §5). The last run pours into the anvil court and strikes the anvil-stone:
// a white flash, and a beat later the crack of a hammer on an anvil (anvil_crack, the Kahre motif).
// The crack wakes the Matron, who unfolds from her alcove in the court wall (A08). The Tender's line is
// the only setup. Then the fight (ch05_cinder_matron).
title: ch05_matron_wakes
location: ch05/ashcrown
---
@camera A07
@sfx anvil_crack
@wait 1.2
@camera A08
@anim matron unfold
Tender as "Tender Ruwen" [worried]: When the anvil rings, the Matron wakes. Be gentle with her if you can. #line:ch05_matron_001
@anim kerrid unsling_cleaver
@mark kerrid court_front walk
@wait 0.8
===
